        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "• Coonan Property presents this beautifully presented, A-rated three-bedroom home, extending to approximately 113 sq.m (1,216 sq.ft), and finished to a high contemporary standard throughout\n• Built in 2023, the property offers all the benefits of a modern, energy-efficient home in a super convenient location \n• Spacious accommodation comprises entrance hallway, guest W.C., living room, kitchen/dining area, utility room, three bedrooms including main bedroom with ensuite, and family bathroom\n• Contemporary fitted kitchen with quartz worktops, integrated Bosch appliances and double French doors opening directly onto the rear garden\n• Beautifully landscaped rear garden featuring a porcelain tiled patio, steel garden shed and a comprehensive French drain system\n• Cobblelock driveway providing off-street parking for two cars, with the property enjoying an attractive position overlooking a green area \n• Ardrath is within easy reach of Celbridge Main Street, Castletown House and Demesne, along with an excellent selection of schools, shops, cafés and local amenities\n• Excellent transport links with convenient access to the N4/M4 road network, regular bus services to Dublin City Centre and Leixlip train station within easy reac\n\nGuide Price\n535,000\n\nType of Transaction\nPrivate Treaty\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Driveway \nCobblelock driveway with off-street parking for two cars, covered entrance with light and overlooking a green to the front. \n\nEntrance Hallway 4.50m x 1.90m\nWood effect tiled floor, 2 light fittings, carpet to the stairs, storage under the stairs. \n\nGuest W.C. 1.90m x 1.67m \nTiled floor, w.c., w.h.b., vertical heated towel rail, window with venetian blinds, light fitting and extractor fan.\n\nLiving Room 3.80m x 4.60m \nCarpet flooring, full-length window overlooking the front, curtains and blinds, standard pendant light fitting, freestanding furniture throughout is not included.\n\nKitchen/Dining 5.80m x 5.70m \nWood effect tiled floor, 3 light fittings, contemporary fitted kitchen with smooth-fronted units and quartz worktops, complete with integrated Bosch oven, Bosch hob, integrated dishwasher and integrated fridge freezer, extractor fan, window with venetian blinds, door with an adjacent glass pane, to the rear garden with roller blinds, generous space for kitchen, living and dining areas with generous sockets with integrated USB points, raised socket for a wall-mounted TV, recessed lighting.\n\nUtility Room 1.10m x 1.90m \nTiled floor, fully plumbed, houses the washer and dryer and the hot water cylinder for the air to water heat pump, extractor fan and light fitting, \n\nLanding 3.70m x 1.50m \nCarpet flooring, window with blinds and light fitting.\n\nMaster Bedroom 3.75m x 4.00m\nFitted wardrobes, carpet flooring, light shade, curtains and blinds, TV point with raised socket for a wall-mounted television.\n\nWalk-In Wardrobe 1.50m x 1.45m \nCarpeted floor, fully shelved and railed with drawers, light fitting.\n\nEnsuite 1.70m x 2.15m \nTiled floor and fully tiled shower cubicle, w.c., w.h.b., vertical heated towel rail, window with venetian blinds, light fitting and extractor fan (fitted mirror not included).\n\nBedroom 2 4.63m x 3.21m \nCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobes with shelving, light shade, curtains and blinds, full-length window.\n\nBedroom 3 4.02m x 2.47m (at max)\nCarpet flooring, blinds, light shade, space above the bed for a wardrobe if required. Fitted shelving over the bulkhead and cabinet with glass not included\n\nBathroom 2.00m x 2.21m \nTiled floor with tiling around the bath and sink, w.c., w.h.b., bath with shower screen and monsoon shower head, mirror with shaving light, vertical heated towel rail, built-in toiletries cabinet under the sink, light fitting and extractor fan.\n\nAttic \nAccessed via a drop-down attic ladder from the landing, partially floored, with power and lighting.\n\nGarden 12.00m x 7.70m \nPorcelain tiled patio, steel shed on a concrete base wired for power (not yet connected), raised beds with a mixture of mature planting, outside light, outside tap, side entrance with gate, PVC fascia and soffit, outside sockets, French drain system installed throughout.\n\nAdditional Information:\nGross internal floor area approx. 113 sq.m (1,216 sq.ft)\nBuilt in 2023\nMonitored alarm system\nRed brick finish to the front elevation \nPlastered finish to the side and back \nSide gate providing access to the rear garden \n\nItems Included in sale:\nIntegrated Bosch oven, Bosch hob, integrated dishwasher and integrated fridge freezer, extractor fan and light fittings. \n\nServices\nMains water\nAir to Water heat pump \n\nBER \nA2\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only.\n\nEircode: W23 T1KK\n\nContact Information\nSales Person \nMick Wright \n016288400\n\n \n"
